sequenceDiagram
    actor Manager as "Sales Manager"
    participant UI as "Interface: UI"
    participant API as "mainController: Controller"
    participant Service as "salesGroupService: Service"
    participant DB as "PostgreSQL: Database"
    Manager->>UI: Open sales-group management
    UI->>+API: POST/PUT /api/v1/sales-groups
    API->>+Service: validateGroupAndScope(request)
    Service->>+DB: Check manager organization scope
    Service->>+DB: Save group, members and retailer assignments
    DB-->>-Service: Updated assignments
    Service-->>-API: Sales group result
    API-->>-UI: Display updated coverage
    Manager->>UI: Reassign Sales or retailer
    UI->>+API: PUT /api/v1/territory-assignments/{type}/{id}
    API->>Service: updateAssignment()
    Service->>DB: Append assignment history and audit
    API-->>-UI: Assignment updated
    Note over Service,DB: New coverage controls future visibility historical order creator and scope remain traceable


